                                <span className="text-gold">변화의 여정</span>을 시작합니다.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        {/* 3. Description & Features (Combined Box) */}
                        <div className="w-full bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg">
